# ==============================================================================
# .gitignore: Context-Aware Heterogeneous Graph Architecture for Fundus Photos
# Only tracks code and configs necessary and discussed in the paper:
#   1. Dataset preparation with patient-level stratification
#   2. Hyperparameter tuning on multilabel, DR, and MF image-only models
#   3. Hyperparameter checking on the remaining singlelabel image-only models
#   4. Final training of all 24 models over 3 different seeds
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Ignore everything by default
*

# 2. General exclusions
*.pt
*.pth
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.log
*.tex
*.md
.venv/
env/
venv/
wandb/
runs/
data/
logs/
.vscode/
scratch/

# 3. Repository Configuration & Environment
!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!README.md
!requirements.txt
!environment.yml

# 4. Step 1: Dataset Preparation with Patient-Level Stratification
!generate_splits.py
!resize_dataset.py
!data_functions/
!data_functions/__init__.py
!data_functions/BRSETDataSplitter.py
!data_functions/BRSETGraphDataset.py
!data_functions/BRSETImageDataset.py

# 5. Step 2: Hyperparameter Tuning (Multilabel, DR, MF Image-Only)
!tune_hyperparams.py
!submit_hparam_tuning.sh

# 6. Step 3: Hyperparameter Checking (Remaining 5 Single-Label Image-Only)
!sweep_remaining_singlelabels.py
!submit_final_sweep.sh

# 7. Step 4: Final Training & Evaluation (All 24 Models Across 3 Seeds)
!train_final_models.py
!submit_final_models.sh

# 8. Core Model Architecture & Shared Utilities
!gnn/
!gnn/__init__.py
!gnn/patientgraphmodel.py
!utils/
!utils/*.py

# 9. Explicit overrides: Caches are never tracked
**/__pycache__/**
*.py[cod]
*$py.class